This table is consulted three times:

1) Determining whether you hit, using the +HIT column.  Your skill in
two-weapon is the lesser of your skill in your primary weapon and your
skill in two-weapon combat.

2) Determining damage dealt by your primary weapon, using the +DAM
column.  Your skill is the lesser of two-weapon and your primary
weapon.

3) Determining the damage dealt by your secondary weapon, using the
+DAM column.  Your skill is the lesser of two-weapon and your
secondary weapon.


